# Copy to .env.local and paste your key. One value, nothing else.
#
#   cp env.local.example .env.local
#   npm run rb:check
#
# .env.local is gitignored by the *.local rule and MUST stay that way:
# alank47/Wildcat-Raffle is a PUBLIC repository, so a licence key committed
# here is a licence key published to the internet. The registry URLs live in
# components.json because they are not secret; only this is.
#
# (This file is named without a leading dot on purpose — .gitignore line 7 is
# `.env.*`, which silently swallows anything called .env.local.example.)
#
# From https://pro.reactbits.dev after purchase. The same key serves both
# namespaces: @reactbits-starter for components, @reactbits-pro for blocks,
# Application UI and the Agent Kit.

REACTBITS_LICENSE_KEY=
